  "body": "Step into the pinnacle of North Shore living with this exceptional north-facing property, perfectly positioned to capture breathtaking, uninterrupted sea and coastal views. Rarely do opportunities of this calibre arise: two homes lovingly maintained, boasting solid construction, and offering expansive potential. Opportunities to secure a premium slice of the Westlake and Rangitoto College zones are increasingly rare—this is your invitation to be part of something truly special.\r\n\r\nTwo Freehold titles: total 951m² (approx.) of sun-drenched land across two titles—an extraordinary parcel in a coveted location, 1/32 and 2/32 Kowhai Road. Flexible Zoning: Residential – Mixed Housing Suburban Zone, inviting a wealth of subdivision or development possibilities (subject to council approval). Superb School Zones: Secure your family’s future with access to Mairangi Bay and Campbells Bay schools, Murrays Bay and Wairau Intermediate, Rangitoto College, and Westlake Boys’ and Girls’ High Schools. Prime Coastal Lifestyle: Wander to Mairangi Bay Village, where boutique shops, cafés, restaurants, and local amenities like the surf club, tennis club, bowling green, and golf course enrich your days. Walk to the Beach: Golden sands and scenic coastal walks are mere minutes away—perfect for families and nature lovers. Unmatched Connectivity: Easy access to bus routes and motorways puts the CBD and the best of Auckland at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re an astute investor, a forward-thinking developer, or someone seeking a blue-chip family oasis, this property offers unlimited potential. The vast, north-facing landholding is a rare gem—ideal for enhancing, land-banking, or creating an iconic residence that will stand the test of time. Here, every convenience is within reach. The area’s enduring popularity and limited supply ensure your investment will continue to grow in appeal and value. Create your dream home, explore lucrative development options, or retain it as a high-performing investment. This is your chance to claim a valuable piece of Campbells Bay’s coastal paradise. Let us help you make this exceptional opportunity yours.",
